WEBVTT

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.040
(GASPING)

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.320
(GASPING)

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.640
-What's happening?
-We're getting thrown out, you idiot.

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:32.840
That's what's happening.

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:44.440
(SIGHING)

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:46.760
(GRUNTING)

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:49.240
-You need a hand?
-I got it.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.440
Here.

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:52.520
So, you gonna miss me
when I'm gone?

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:55.000
-If I say no, do I still get your room?
-Nope.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:56.920
MOLLY: Then, yes, I'll miss you.

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.800
(GASPING) I can't breathe!

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:01.160
-Oh, this can't be happening!
-Quiet! What's that sound?

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:02.440
(LADDER CREAKING)

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.280
(ALL EXCLAIMING)

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:11.920
Oh!

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.160
Andy! (SIGHS)

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.440
(GASPS) That's not trash.
That's not trash!

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:20.480
Think, think, Woody.
Think, think, think. Oh!

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:21.640
(WHISTLES)

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.160
Buster! Come here, boy! Come here!

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:32.280
Okay, boy. To the curb! Hee-yah!

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:34.080
(YAWNING)

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:35.640
(WOODY GRUNTS)

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:37.480
(STRAINING) No, Buster! No!

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:42.320
WOODY: Get up. Buster!

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:46.760
(PANTING)

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:47.960
Oh!

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:55.680
(GASPS)

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:00.400
-We're on the curb!
-Oh, I knew it would come to this!

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:01.960
Pull, everyone! Pull!

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:10.800
(SCREAMS)

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:14.400
-REX: It won't rip!
-Oh, forget it!

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:17.120
It's triple-ply,
high-density polyethylene!

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:18.360
There's gotta be a way out!

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:20.040
Oh, Andy doesn't want us.
What's the point?

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:21.680
Point. Point. Point!

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:26.800
Push! Push!

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.360
I can hear the garbage truck!

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:31.160
It's getting closer.

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:40.400
(HUMMING GUITAR RIFFS)

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:44.840
(EXCLAIMING IN DISGUST)

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:05.920
Oh!

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:10.080
Buzz! Jessie!

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:12.000
(SOFT CLINKING)

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:18.400
(SIGHS IN RELIEF)

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:21.360
-Andy threw us out.
-Like we were garbage.

00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:24.120
-Junk. He called us junk.
-How could he?

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:25.280
(CRYING)

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.080
This doesn't make any sense.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:30.720
I should have seen this coming.
It's Emily all over again.

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:33.240
-Sarge was right.
-Yeah, and Woody was wrong.

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:35.880
Wait a minute. Wait, hold on.
This is no time to be hysterical.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.640
It's the perfect time to be hysterical.

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:39.440
-Should we be hysterical?
-No!

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:41.560
-Yes!
-Maybe! But not right now!

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:46.200
Yee-haw! Fellas, I know what to do.

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:53.440
What the heck?

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:58.200
-Oh, we should've done this years ago.
-Jessie, wait. What about Woody?

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:01.280
He's fine, Buzz.
Andy's taking him to college.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:02.960
Now we need to go!

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:05.880
You're right. Come on.

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.280
-Buzz?
-Woody!

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:11.440
What's going on? Don't you know
this box is being donated?

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.480
It's under control, Woody.
We have a plan.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.800
We're going to daycare!

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:17.520
Daycare?
What, have you all lost your marbles?

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:20.160
Well, didn't you see?
Andy threw us away.

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:22.920
No, no, no, no.
He was putting you in the attic.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.800
Attic? So how did we
end up on the curb?

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:27.560
That was a mistake.
Andy's mom thought you were trash.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:30.040
Yeah. After he put us in a trash bag.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:31.480
And called us junk!

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:34.760
Yeah, I know. It looks bad.
But, guys, you gotta believe me.

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.640
Sure thing, college boy!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.640
Andy's moving on, Woody.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:40.560
It's time we did the same.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:44.000
Okay. Out of the box.
Everyone, right now!

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:47.000
Come on, Buzz. Give me a hand.
We gotta get this thing outta here.

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:50.360
Woody, wait. We need to figure out
what's best for everyone.

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:58.360
Oh, great. Great! It's gonna take us
forever to get back here.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.520
(CRYING) (CRYING)

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:10.480
Oh, it's all right, Barbie.
You'll be okay.

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:15.200
Well, Molly and I have been
growing apart for years.

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:19.560
It's just... I can't believe
she would throw me away!

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.920
Welcome to the club, toots.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:25.280
Okay, everyone, listen up. We can get
back to Andy's, but we gotta move fast.

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:27.080
We'll hide under the seats
till we get back home.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.760
Get it through your vinyl noggin,
Woody.

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:29.960
Andy doesn't want us anymore.

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:32.440
He was putting you in the attic!

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:34.560
He left us on the curb!

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:37.400
-All right, calm down! Both of you!
-Okay, fine. Fine.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.080
Just wait till you see
what daycare's like.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:42.760
-Why? What's it like?
-Daycare is a sad, lonely place

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:46.040
for washed-up old toys
who have no owners.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:49.120
(BAWLING)

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.800
-Quite the charmer, aren't ya?
-WOODY: Oh, you'll see.

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:53.440
As soon as we get to daycare,
you'll be begging to go home.

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:54.520
(THUD)

